  "body": "Implementation of an ID design that has not landed yet (partial implementation as of the 2026-11-04 inventory).\n\nDesign issue: #835\nDesign doc: `doc/2026-11-01_design_id835.md` (in developing-today/code)\n\nAcceptance, in brief: builder and moderator authority enforced through world-session frames per the design.\nCurrent state: world-session frames exist; builder/moderator authority roles are not landed.\n\nThe design documents govern. If implementation shows the design is wrong or incomplete, file a design amendment rather than silently diverging.\n\nScope: pkgs/id and its tests. Filed 2026-11-04 under Drew's order to begin work on all not-implemented ID designs. Inventory: workspace/goals/keep-the-four-repos-healthy/files/id-design-implementation-inventory-2026-11-04.md (in the fleet workspace).",
